# Data Flow - Databases and File Stores

How data flows between components and stores.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Core as AI Company Builder
    participant TaskStore
    participant AuditStore
    participant EscalationStore
    participant KPIPipeline
    participant CostAnalytics
    participant AgentPerf as AgentPerformanceAnalytics
    participant FileStore
    participant WorkflowEngine
    participant Athena

    User->>Core: Submit task/request
    Core->>TaskStore: Create/update task
    TaskStore->>Core: Task persisted (SQLite)

    Core->>AuditStore: Record audit event
    AuditStore->>Core: Event persisted

    alt Escalation needed
        Core->>EscalationStore: Record escalation
        EscalationStore->>Core: Persisted
    end

    alt Workflow execution
        Core->>WorkflowEngine: Execute workflow
        WorkflowEngine->>FileStore: Persist instance state (workflows/instances/*.json)
        FileStore->>WorkflowEngine: State saved
    end

    alt Athena operation
        Core->>Athena: Process request
        Athena->>FileStore: Append to JSONL (company/athena/*.jsonl)
        FileStore->>Athena: Persisted
    end

    Core->>KPIPipeline: Record/update KPI
    Core->>CostAnalytics: Record cost
    Core->>AgentPerf: Update metrics

    Note over FileStore: Atomic writes, file locking, backups (.bak), corruption recovery
```
